title: Antonie Pfülf
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/portraits/PfülfAntonie.jpg
view-if: pfulf_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Antonie Pfülf

Pfülf is [? if chancellor = "Pfülf": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Pfülf": the current President and ?] a former teacher from Bavaria who came from a conservative Catholic family. She is an activist for women's rights and for broadening the support of the SPD. 

- @support_peoples_party
- @build_peoples_party
- @campaigning_peoples_party
- @womens_rights_
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@support_peoples_party
title: Build support for a People's Party
subtitle: Can we expand our party beyond the industrial working class?
view-if: peoples_party = 0
choose-if: peoples_party_support <= 4 and advisor_action_timer = 0 and peoples_party = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if peoples_party_support > 4: There is already substantial support for a People's Party. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; peoples_party_support += 1; reformist_strength += 5;

We are building up support for the idea of a People's Party.

@build_peoples_party
title: Building a People's Party
subtitle: Can we expand our party beyond the industrial working class?
view-if: peoples_party = 0
choose-if: peoples_party_support >= 3 and advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if peoples_party_support < 3: There is not enough support for this policy within the party. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: peoples_party

@campaigning_peoples_party
title: Campaigning as a People's Party
subtitle: Campaigning with some of our previously nontraditional demographics.
view-if: peoples_party = 1
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: peoples_party_campaigning


@womens_rights_
title: Women's rights
subtitle: Enact policy with regards to women's rights.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The SPD is not currently in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; womens_rights_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: womens_rights

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Pfülf can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Pfülf"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Pfülf can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Pfülf"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: reichsexekution
